WEBVTT

00:11.720 --> 00:16.430
#Hi10anime Via kBaraka Presents

00:12.090 --> 00:16.470
Tengen Toppa Gurren-Lagann OVA 1 - EP 2

00:16.470 --> 00:19.060
kimi wa kikoeru?

00:16.470 --> 00:19.060
Can you hear?

00:19.060 --> 00:21.810
Boku no kono koe ga

00:19.060 --> 00:21.810
My voice

00:21.810 --> 00:27.070
yami ni munashiku suikomareta

00:21.810 --> 00:27.070
uselessly swallowed up by the darkness

00:27.400 --> 00:29.900
moshimo sekai ga

00:27.400 --> 00:29.900
If this world

00:29.900 --> 00:32.610
imi wo motsuno nara

00:29.900 --> 00:32.610
has any meaning

00:32.610 --> 00:35.240
kon na kimochi mo

00:32.610 --> 00:35.240
does my feeling like this

00:35.240 --> 00:37.540
muda de wa nai?

00:35.240 --> 00:37.540
also mean something?

00:37.540 --> 00:40.790
Akogare ni oshitsubusarete

00:37.540 --> 00:40.790
Squashed by my aspirations

00:40.790 --> 00:43.540
akiramete tanda

00:40.790 --> 00:43.540
I was giving up

00:43.540 --> 00:46.130
hateshinai sora no iro mo

00:43.540 --> 00:46.130
without even knowing

00:46.130 --> 00:48.670
shiranaide

00:46.130 --> 00:48.670
the colors of this boundless sky

00:49.090 --> 00:54.010
hashiri dashita omoi ga ima demo

00:49.090 --> 00:54.010
Because I still can feel my heart

00:54.340 --> 00:59.770
kono mune wo tashika ni tataiteru kara

00:54.340 --> 00:59.770
knocking on my chest just like
when it all started

00:59.980 --> 01:05.270
kyoh no boku ga sono saki ni tsuzuku

00:59.980 --> 01:05.270
The person I am today

01:05.270 --> 01:10.860
bokura nari no asu wo kizuite yuku

01:05.270 --> 01:10.860
will build our own tomorrow

01:11.240 --> 01:19.410
kotae wa so itsumo koko ni aru

01:11.240 --> 01:19.700
Yes, the answer is always right here

01:53.090 --> 01:54.860
Operation begin

02:07.760 --> 02:13.270
My Gurren is Shiny!

02:17.090 --> 02:17.790
My eyes !

02:18.190 --> 02:21.030
l've gone blind

02:22.490 --> 02:23.390
Bro

02:24.130 --> 02:24.860
What's wrong?

02:25.000 --> 02:27.560
Simon
All of a sudden l can't see anything anymore

02:27.930 --> 02:30.400
l'm doomed to a life of darkness

02:34.830 --> 02:35.800
Dumbass.

02:37.290 --> 02:37.960
Huh?

02:38.260 --> 02:38.930
l can see...

02:39.430 --> 02:41.330
These things are absolutely filthy!

02:45.360 --> 02:47.230
This is just awful, isn't it?

02:49.960 --> 02:51.600
Just leave it to me

02:58.630 --> 02:59.730
Let me see those

03:05.690 --> 03:06.560
What is it?

03:08.090 --> 03:09.360
l can see every curve

03:09.390 --> 03:10.560
That's amazing, Chitori

03:12.830 --> 03:18.000
lf you think so l could clean the Gurren for you, Lord Kamina.

03:18.730 --> 03:19.460
Oh?

03:19.930 --> 03:21.460
Oh, yeah.

03:25.030 --> 03:27.130
Hey,why is the Lagann so clean?

03:27.690 --> 03:30.500
lt reflects all the heartfelt work l put into maintaining it.

03:31.790 --> 03:33.260
What?

03:33.290 --> 03:34.730
Are you making fun of me?

03:34.890 --> 03:38.460
Just watch, soon enough my Gurren will shine

03:38.790 --> 03:40.800
Get to washing, Chitori

03:41.790 --> 03:43.300
He's making someone else do it...

03:44.630 --> 03:46.500
with your permission, let's clean up

03:47.060 --> 03:48.160
This won't take long

03:53.930 --> 03:55.060
Take Look Simon

03:55.660 --> 03:57.560
A man's mech is a man's soul

03:57.930 --> 03:59.560
You can be as carefree as you want with them.

03:59.630 --> 04:01.830
You'll think so as well soon enough

04:04.090 --> 04:05.400
Listen to me, dammit

04:10.830 --> 04:11.760
Ganmen

04:18.960 --> 04:20.600
Alright Let's go Simon

04:21.390 --> 04:22.900
Why are you riding with me?

04:23.760 --> 04:25.560
Gurren's in the middle of its wash

04:26.130 --> 04:28.930
For Ganmen like that, Lagann's good enough

04:29.190 --> 04:30.800
Let's go Simon

04:33.000 --> 04:34.430
The thought of you two on your own is disturbing

04:43.760 --> 04:44.600
Huh?

04:49.530 --> 04:50.430
Hold it

04:51.790 --> 04:53.300
Take care

04:53.490 --> 04:54.960
Be careful

05:04.360 --> 05:05.730
Something's off...

05:06.430 --> 05:08.100
This one's just running away.

05:08.890 --> 05:10.900
The Gurren Brigade has stricken him with terror

05:11.390 --> 05:13.600
Could it be we're being lured into something?

05:13.790 --> 05:14.830
You don't mean a trap?

05:15.330 --> 05:17.260
Yeah, but for what purpose?

05:17.660 --> 05:18.960
Stop

05:19.290 --> 05:20.230
What'd you say?

05:20.490 --> 05:22.060
Simon, Iet's go back

05:22.590 --> 05:24.830
We'll wipe'em out with the Gurren Lagann

05:25.560 --> 05:27.960
You should have just said so from the start..

05:28.000 --> 05:29.430
Quit your complaining

05:29.530 --> 05:31.160
My Gurren'swaiting for us

05:39.530 --> 05:40.330
What the...?

05:41.630 --> 05:42.330
Gurren!

05:42.660 --> 05:43.930
Why is it here?

05:47.660 --> 05:50.260
Magnificent... my Gurren

05:50.630 --> 05:52.960
That's not what you should be concerned about

05:54.000 --> 05:54.760
Leeron?

05:54.930 --> 05:55.660
Leeron?

05:56.390 --> 05:57.160
Leeron

05:59.060 --> 06:00.360
ls the Gurren there?

06:00.730 --> 06:01.600
The Gurren?

06:01.660 --> 06:02.660
One moment.

06:03.590 --> 06:05.100
The Gurren, let's see...

06:06.630 --> 06:07.630
lt vanished

06:08.660 --> 06:10.500
And we can't go out, either

06:16.390 --> 06:17.700
Damn it...

06:18.060 --> 06:20.460
What son of a bitch has the nerve to steal my Gurren?

06:20.730 --> 06:21.930
What're you talking about?

06:21.960 --> 06:26.600
Before this, didn't you humans steal these Ganmen from us?

06:27.090 --> 06:29.400
l'm just taking back what's mine!

06:39.230 --> 06:40.460
Gurren Lagann...

06:40.590 --> 06:43.830
without Gurren, it's merely a puny little face.

06:43.860 --> 06:45.730
Are you shaking yet , human scum?

06:48.330 --> 06:49.630
Bro what should we do?

06:49.660 --> 06:52.260
Okay, let's combine with it

06:52.630 --> 06:56.230
lf we combine with it,the Gurren will be under our control

06:56.660 --> 06:57.700
That's ridiculous

06:58.000 --> 06:58.000
Who cares if it's ridiculous, just go

06:59.630 --> 07:00.730
l get it already

07:01.130 --> 07:03.230
GOOOOOO!

07:03.430 --> 07:05.360
l thought you'd try that

07:06.830 --> 07:08.330
GURREN HOMERUN!!

07:13.660 --> 07:16.060
This beastman isn't too bad it seems

07:16.560 --> 07:17.600
Who are you?

07:17.930 --> 07:20.060
You humans aren't bad either.

07:20.360 --> 07:22.600
My name is Jigitalis

07:22.690 --> 07:22.690
That's perfect, now you'll get to meet Kamina-sama

07:26.290 --> 07:27.700
Bro that's a cliff

07:30.130 --> 07:30.890
Bro!

07:30.960 --> 07:33.060
Honestly, where does his idiocy end?

07:33.090 --> 07:35.830
He took care of himself, next l'll send you two after him

07:38.630 --> 07:40.400
l wonder if Bro is okay?

07:40.690 --> 07:43.300
He'll be fine , just worry about yourself for now

07:45.390 --> 07:47.700
Jeez, I thought Iwas gonna die

07:52.260 --> 07:53.130
That's...?

07:56.330 --> 07:57.560
Running away?

08:00.860 --> 08:02.060
Damn_

08:03.960 --> 08:06.030
USAGGON KICK

08:08.830 --> 08:09.360
Ah_

08:09.530 --> 08:10.360
That's...

08:11.390 --> 08:13.200
You're getting sloppy, Simon

08:13.360 --> 08:15.100
That voice... is that you, Bro?

08:15.130 --> 08:16.090
Of course

08:16.190 --> 08:17.860
l'm the indestructible Kamina-sama

08:17.960 --> 08:20.830
Even if you send me to hell, l'll come back unharmed

08:21.430 --> 08:22.960
That's not Usaggon_

08:23.000 --> 08:24.760
That's my Daorek

08:25.060 --> 08:26.760
So this is your Ganmen?

08:26.890 --> 08:28.760
You've got some nasty hobbies.

08:29.230 --> 08:29.230
That's just like you damn humans

08:31.090 --> 08:33.700
What can you claim to know about the beauty of animals?

08:33.730 --> 08:35.260
l don't know anything, and l don't care

08:35.760 --> 08:36.560
How's that?

08:38.230 --> 08:38.230
Alright Simon, c'mere_

08:39.760 --> 08:40.560
Let's combine

08:41.960 --> 08:45.460
l can't take back my Gurren with this dumb Ganmen.

08:45.560 --> 08:47.130
Let's see if we can transform it with a combination

08:47.230 --> 08:51.230
l told you before ,the Ganmen belonged to us originally!

08:52.090 --> 08:55.000
Combining with that thing is asking too much

08:55.860 --> 08:58.460
You're my underling, l'm not asking you nicely

08:58.530 --> 09:00.900
All you have to do is follow my instructions

09:01.160 --> 09:03.060
lt's okay,just do it

09:09.360 --> 09:10.100
Did you see it?

09:10.130 --> 09:12.360
Rabbit's ears Flaming and burning

09:12.630 --> 09:13.760
Forced Combination

09:13.790 --> 09:15.260
Usaggon Lagann

09:15.630 --> 09:17.430
What ridiculous nonsense are you spouting?

09:18.060 --> 09:19.590
lt's not Usaggon

09:19.690 --> 09:21.760
l told you, that's my Daorek

09:22.090 --> 09:22.960
Eat this

09:23.090 --> 09:24.660
Usaggon Punch

09:27.660 --> 09:29.760
Bro fight normally

09:29.960 --> 09:31.560
You think l can like this?

09:31.890 --> 09:33.260
Take this

09:35.360 --> 09:36.100
What?

09:45.060 --> 09:46.830
Now's our chance  Go Simon !

09:52.290 --> 09:53.730
W-What the--?

09:59.660 --> 10:00.600
We got it

10:04.760 --> 10:06.860
Like I thought , this place suits me best.

10:07.590 --> 10:09.100
You bastard...

10:14.030 --> 10:15.160
Stop right there

10:18.790 --> 10:20.500
lf you don't feel like dying , that is.

10:20.860 --> 10:23.530
Stealing my Gurren is a high crime.

10:24.030 --> 10:26.630
lf you want to keep those ears of yours, don't move a muscle

10:32.690 --> 10:33.490
Huh?

10:34.230 --> 10:35.960
Hey, hurry up pops

10:36.330 --> 10:37.960
You saved me, Chitori

10:38.330 --> 10:40.630
The operation was a failure, let's run

10:42.160 --> 10:45.930
l'll remember this Kamina,you damn swindler

10:48.860 --> 10:51.260
Hey Waita minute, goddamn it

10:51.330 --> 10:51.330
Are you running off like a coward?

10:52.760 --> 10:52.760
Oh well.
Are you running off like a coward?

10:53.890 --> 10:53.990
Oh well.

10:57.960 --> 11:00.560
My Gurren's all trashed up!

11:00.890 --> 11:02.400
lt's payback for your laziness.

11:02.530 --> 11:04.100
Do it yourself this time.

11:06.290 --> 11:07.500
Goddamn it

11:07.590 --> 11:11.830
You'll pay for this Jigitalis

11:13.930 --> 11:14.930
End
